# RoamVantage — 360 viewer

## Package

- `@jeffgo10/panorama-viewer@0.1.2` (ls-foundry)
- App wrapper: `src/components/viewer/panorama-viewer.tsx` (`dynamic` + `ssr: false` + styles)
- `transpilePackages: ["@jeffgo10/panorama-viewer"]` in `next.config.ts`
- Import CSS via wrapper (`@jeffgo10/panorama-viewer/styles.css`) — do not re-add local Pannellum CDN

## Usage

- Props: `imageUrl`, `markers` (`PanoramaMarker`), `mode` (`view` | `edit`), `onSphereClick`, `onMarkerClick`, `fitParent`
- Marker kinds: `navigation` | `info` | `label`; content types: text / image / html / rich
- Used by: `/properties/[id]/edit`, `/t/[slug]`

